            <!--
             | AeroVance component policies.
             |
             | Every visual variant below is a Style System entry rather than a dialog field.
             | That is deliberate: a variant chosen in a dialog is a content decision an author
             | has to re-make on every instance, while a style is a design decision the policy
             | makes once per template. It also means retiring a variant is one policy edit
             | rather than a content migration.
             |
             | cq:styleIds are stable identifiers, so a style label can be reworded without
             | changing which class lands on existing content.
            -->
